{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1333056-how-would-you-summarize-the-powers-of-the-various-types-of-exalted","id":1333056,"title":"How would you summarize the powers of the various types of Exalted?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-08-28T19:46:36-07:00","id":1333056,"title":"How would you summarize the powers of the various types of Exalted?","content":"You can use this wiki to describe: <a href=\"https://powerlisting.fandom.com/wiki/Superpower_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\">https://powerlisting.fandom.com/wiki/Superpower_Wiki</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-28T19:56:17-07:00","id":1333058,"title":"","content":"General: Enhanced resilience, accelerated learning, extreme disease resistance, expanded life span, low grade healing factor.<br /> <br /> Exigent: TBD case by case<br /> <br /> Liminal: Conditional immortality, part assimilation, reanimation, <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-28T20:18:26-07:00","id":1333062,"title":"","content":"{deep inhalation} \u2026I can't. Not just like that.<br /> <br /> They're complicated persons you see, Aunty. Sometimes they're nice, and sometimes they're <b>nasty</b>.<br /> <br /> And sometimes they just like to sing little songs like &quot;See the little goblin, see his little--","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-29T01:52:01-07:00","id":1333078,"title":"","content":"Feet.<br /> <br /> Solars are <i>Excellent</i>. They have <i>supernatural skill</i> and they <i>shine with the power of the king of heaven</i>. These <i>Lawgivers</i> are metaphorical <i>champions of light</i> (but exist in a world where might makes right). They are <i>leaders</i> and the <i>most powerful</i> Exalted. Their powers make them <i>flawless</i> and <i>invulnerable</i>, and whilst this is not indefinite it is sufficient to destroy the creators of the world, threats from beyond existence, demon kings and mighty gods. Solars can <i>slay immortals</i>. Solars can <i>build great works</i>, even <i>creating new lands</i>, including the <i>exotic</i> and <i>permanent</i>. They are just as <i>adept</i> at <i>working with flesh</i> or <i>social institutions</i>. They are the invincible god-kings of the dawn.<br /> <br /> Supernatural Condition<br /> Light Manipulation<br /> Magic<br /> Adaptive Power-Level<br /> (Nigh) Ultipotence (potential, reached through experience)<br /> <br /> Lunars are the <i>ultimate survivors</i>. They are <i>shapeshifters</i> and <i>tricksters</i> who <i>do the impossible</i>. They are the <i>children of the moon</i>. These <i>Stewards</i> are <i>equal but different</i> to the Lawgivers.<br /> <br /> Shapeshifting<br /> --Enhanced Condition (Type II)<br /> --Balanced Mode<br /> Dark Light Manipulation<br /> Magic<br /> Adaptive Power-Level<br /> Absolute Condition (potential)<br /> <br /> Sidereals are <i>masters of fate and destiny</i>. The powers of these <i>Viziers</i> are <i>esotoric</i> and <i>inscrutable</i> -- not least of which being their <i>reality warping</i> mystic <i>kung fu</i>.<br /> <br /> Supernatural Condition<br /> Reality Warping<br /> Magic<br /> Nigh Omniscience<br /> <br /> The Dragon-Blooded are <i>elemental super-soliders</i>. Like the Lawgivers, the power of the Terrestrial Exalted derrives from their <i>supernatural skill</i>. The weakest of the Exalted, they are built to slay demons, little gods, ghosts and hobgoblins. Their powers <i>grow when working cooperatively</i> and they <i>manipulate the elements</i> both literally and metaphysically.<br /> <br /> Enhanced Condition (starting at Type I at adolescence, progressing to Type II with experiance)<br /> Elemental Manipulation<br /> Support Powers<br /> Magic<br /> (<i>Rare potential</i> for) Supernatural Condition<br /> <br /> ****<br /> <br /> Beyond this, N/A artifacts like The Eye can push anyone to Nigh Omnipotence. But Exalted isn't about &quot;bigger numbers&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 08-29-2019, 12:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244